flowchart LR
    accTitle: Choose an AI provider by evidence
    accDescr: Start with workload outcomes and constraints, map current capabilities, evaluate representative tasks, compare operational evidence, record the decision, and revisit it on a scheduled date.

    W[Workload outcome] --> C[Constraints and risk]
    C --> M[Map current candidate capabilities]
    M --> E[Build representative evaluation]
    E --> Q[Compare quality and safety]
    E --> O[Compare latency, cost, and operations]
    E --> P[Compare portability and exit cost]
    Q --> D{Evidence meets thresholds?}
    O --> D
    P --> D
    D -->|No| M
    D -->|Yes| R[Record choice, assumptions, and fallback]
    R --> V[Set review date]
    V -. capability or requirement change .-> M
